── growth_proximity_weight CURVE (growth lane, n=80) ──
  SLOPE of the distance-below-own-high dock: score ×(1 + w·(range_pct/100 − 1)).
  1.0 = SHIPPED (raw multiply: a name at 80% of range keeps 0.80 of its score, one at the high keeps 1.00).
